{"id":"e64af5d0cd2d6b75","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization.md","title":"Characterization of Horn Sentences","display":"thm-horn-sentence-characterization — Characterization of Horn Sentences","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"6.3","source_result":"Theorem 6.2.5' (without CH)","source_pages_print":"445","source_pages_djvu":"461","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization","aliases":["17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization"],"display":"thm-horn-sentence-characterization — Characterization of Horn Sentences","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-horn-formula]]","[[17-df-reduced-product-preservation]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-6.3.2","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 6.2.5' (without CH)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"445"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"461"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-horn-sentence-characterization — Characterization of Horn Sentences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3979795456a966f2\" href=\"?note=3979795456a966f2\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-preservation\">17-df-reduced-product-preservation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.3.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为待检验句子。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (structures and truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\)</span> (Horn sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\\)</span> (reduced-product preservation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3979795456a966f2\" href=\"?note=3979795456a966f2\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-preservation\">17-df-reduced-product-preservation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Horn syntax is characterized by preservation under arbitrary reduced products, not by preservation under untyped “homomorphisms.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-horn-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-horn-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ and $\\models$ (structures and truth, see [[17-df-structure]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df